WEBVTT

00:04.100 --> 00:06.810
Papa went downstairs before the rain stopped.

00:09.600 --> 00:11.860
I left a paper bird on your doorstep.

00:12.430 --> 00:13.430
There are more inside.

00:17.350 --> 00:20.020
I heard him call from two rooms at once.

00:21.330 --> 00:22.760
Both of them sounded like him.

00:23.900 --> 00:25.040
PAPA, FROM THE LEFT: I'm down here.

00:25.400 --> 00:26.900
PAPA'S VOICE, FROM THE RIGHT: I'm down here.

00:27.820 --> 00:29.010
Follow my birds.

00:29.640 --> 00:30.970
Keep your lantern lit.

00:32.510 --> 00:34.830
Before the house learns your voice, too.
